title: Class Consciousness of the Peasants and Rural Working Class
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: socialism >= 50 and rural_spd_normalized >= 15 and rural_policy >= 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
card-image: img/rural-conscious.jpg
face-image: img/rural-conscious.jpg
max-visits: 1


= Class Consciousness of the Peasants and Rural Working Class

Due to our introduction of agrarian policies and the increased popularity of socialism, we now have a chance to raise the consciousness of the peasantry and the rural working class. [? if peoples_party==0: As <span style="color: #9B0000;">Marxists</span>, we are predominantly a party of the industrial proletariat and believe that they are the driving force of the transition to socialism. Many <span style="color: #9B0000;">Marxist</span> intellectuals have long debated whether the peasantry can be brought to the socialist cause. ?][? if peoples_party==1: Despite becoming a people’s party, our party has traditionally neglected rural workers and peasants, with the industrial working class previously being our main focus. ?] We could awaken the class consciousness of the peasantry and the rural working class  as a way to expand the <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span>’s base [? if peoples_party==0: without diluting its class character ?] and to build urban-rural solidarity.

- @awaken: Awaken their class consciousness!
- @refute: No, we will not do this.
- @easy_discard_1: Return card to hand.
- @cancel_advisor_action

@easy_discard_1
view-if: last_advisor_action = 0
go-to: easy_discard

@awaken
choose-if: baade_advisor or radio >= 2 or commercialized_media >=2
subtitle: [? if baade_advisor: Baade, through his expertise on agriculture, can help us raise the consciousness of the rural workers and peasants. ?] [? if radio >= 2 and not baade_advisor: We can use our existing radio program for this. ?] [? if commercialized_media >= 2 and not baade_advisor: We can use our existing newspapers for this. ?]
unavailable-subtitle: [? if radio < 2 and not baade_advisor: Consider hiring Baade, or expanding radio programs ?] [? if commercialized_media < 2 and not baade_advisor: Considering hiring Baade, or commercializing our newspapers. ?]
on-arrival: rural_spd += 10*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 3; left_strength += 5; reformist_strength += 5; labor_strength += 5; socialism += 4*(1 - dissent); rural_conscious = 1

We have taken advantage of the situation and have awoken the class consciousness of the peasantry and the rural workers. Increasingly, the flock to our party. 

@refute

We will not do this.
